flowchart LR
    Model[Model planner]
    Session[Session and turn state]
    Router[ToolRouter]
    Registry[ToolRegistry]
    Policy[Exec policy]
    Approval[Approval store / reviewer]
    Sandbox[Sandbox and network policy]
    Local[Local process / filesystem]
    Exec[Exec-server boundary]
    MCP[MCP provider]
    App[App-server client]
    Store[Rollout and history]

    Model -->|proposes name + payload| Router
    Session --> Router
    Router --> Registry
    Registry --> Policy
    Policy --> Approval
    Approval --> Sandbox
    Sandbox --> Local
    Sandbox --> Exec
    Registry --> MCP
    App --> Session
    Registry --> Store
    Local --> Store
    Exec --> Store
    MCP --> Store
    Store --> Model

    classDef authority fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#842029,color:#000;
    classDef projection fill:#d1e7dd,stroke:#0f5132,color:#000;
